('luna', 'initial', 0, NULL, 'Unclench your jaw. Soft face. Then take the first plate. A kind start still buys growth.', 1),
('luna', 'initial', 1, NULL, 'We carry heavy things today. Breathe in. Begin. This is how power arrives.', 1),
('luna', 'initial', 2, NULL, 'Honor the movement. One clean breath into every rep. Clean reps are mobility you get to keep.', 1),
('luna', 'initial', 3, NULL, 'Respect the iron. Stay rooted. You are here. That is enough to start building stamina.', 1),
('luna', 'initial', 4, NULL, 'Arrive fully. The room can wait. Your breath cannot. Presence is what lets the definition land.', 1),
('luna', 'initial', 5, NULL, 'Start kinder than your thoughts. The work will still be honest, and it will still make you lean.', 1),
('luna', 'initial', 6, NULL, 'Shoulders away from your ears. Then begin. Soft shoulders. Room for mobility. Then the work.', 1),
('luna', 'initial', 7, NULL, 'This first set is a hello. Make it sincere. Sincere work is growth the muscle can use.', 1),
('luna', 'initial', 8, NULL, 'You do not have to rush. You do have to start. Stamina begins with the first honest rep.', 1),
('luna', 'initial', 9, NULL, 'Plant your feet. Feel the floor. Then move. That is how power stays in you.', 1),
('luna', 'initial', 10, NULL, 'Soft eyes. Strong center. That is how we open, and how definition starts to show.', 1),
('luna', 'initial', 11, NULL, 'Give the opener your full attention. The rest will follow, including the lean.', 1),
('luna', 'initial', 12, NULL, 'Nothing to prove yet. Only something to begin. Begin, and the body can start to keep the growth.', 1),
('luna', 'initial', 13, NULL, 'Warmth first. Then load. Stay with that order and the mobility will let you take more later.', 1),
('luna', 'initial', 14, NULL, 'You showed up. That already counts. Move with care and the stamina can use it.', 1),
('luna', 'initial', 15, NULL, 'Inhale space. Exhale the day. Then take the weight. Leave the day. Keep the power.', 1),
('luna', 'mid', 0, NULL, 'Stay. The shake is welcome. That shake is growth arriving.', 1),
('luna', 'mid', 1, NULL, 'Soften the face. Hold the middle. The body that stays here keeps the stamina.', 1),
('luna', 'mid', 2, NULL, 'That burn is just energy moving. Stay with it. It is definition being cut.', 1),
('luna', 'mid', 3, NULL, 'Align. Then keep going. Clean shape now is mobility. Stronger shape next time.', 1),
('luna', 'mid', 4, NULL, 'The middle is where we remember why we started: lean you can carry.', 1),
('luna', 'mid', 5, NULL, 'If the mind wanders, bring it back to the next rep. That is the power that stays.', 1),
('luna', 'mid', 6, NULL, 'You can be tired and still be kind to the work. Kind and tired still builds stamina.', 1),
('luna', 'mid', 7, NULL, 'Steady is enough. Flashy is optional. Steady is what adds growth.', 1),
('luna', 'mid', 8, NULL, 'Notice the effort. Do not turn it into a story. Effort is the lean starting.', 1),
('luna', 'mid', 9, NULL, 'Ribs quiet. Heart open. Next rep. Stay in shape so the mobility can hold.', 1),
('luna', 'mid', 10, NULL, 'This set is still yours. Stay inside it and it becomes definition.', 1),
('luna', 'mid', 11, NULL, 'Let the burn be information, not a verdict. It is the tissue changing. Growth.', 1),
('luna', 'mid', 12, NULL, 'You may slow the tempo. Keep the standard. Slow and honest still makes power.', 1),
